 assets:broker2 || 2026-02-01  27d  10 AAPL       $20                    $200                                                  
----------------++-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
                ||                  20 AAPL       $20                    $400                                                  

# ** 42. The cost column's heading matches what is shown: with --lots it is
# "Unit cost", or "Avg cost" when the lots shown all use AVERAGE (test 39),
