# ** 43. Assets held in a lots:NONE account do not appear in the holdings report,
# or affect its aggregated values. Eg assets:ira does not affect this --depth 1 report.
<
commodity AAA ; lots:
account assets:ira  ; lots: NONE

2026-01-01 buy in taxable and tax-sheltered accounts
    assets:cash      $-200
    assets:broker    10 AAA {$10}
    assets:ira       10 AAA @ $10

