--------++------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
        ||                  10 AAA       $10                    $100                                                  

# ** 44. A zero-cost lot (eg bonus shares / a stock dividend) is fully valued: its name keeps
# the cost commodity ({..., $0}, not {..., 0}), so its value commodity is
# known and Unit price, Total value, UGain and the totals appear.
<
commodity AAA ; lots:

2025-01-01 buy
    assets:cash     $-100
    assets:broker   10 AAA {$10}

2025-02-01 bonus shares
    assets:broker    5 AAA @@ $0
    equity:bonus    -5 AAA @@ $0

P 2025-12-31 AAA $11

$ hledger -f- holdings --lots -e 2026-01-02
