<
commodity AAA ; lots:

2026-01-01 buy in parent
    assets:broker        2 AAA @ $10
    assets:cash

2026-02-01 buy in subaccount
    assets:broker:sub    3 AAA @ $20
    assets:cash

2026-03-01 sell one from subaccount
    assets:broker:sub   -1 AAA @ $30
    assets:cash          $30

P 2026-03-31 AAA $25
