# ** 48. Avg cost is shown with the cost commodity's display precision,
# like the other amounts, and adds up to 2 decimal digits beyond it when
# the average is inexact (so eg $100.333.. is not shown as $100).
<
commodity AAA ; lots:
commodity $1,000.00

2026-01-01 buys averaging exactly $100
    assets:even    5 AAA @ $90
    assets:even    5 AAA @ $110
    assets:cash

2026-02-01 buys averaging $100.333..
    assets:odd     5 AAA @ $90
    assets:odd     5 AAA @ $110
    assets:odd     5 AAA @ $101
    assets:cash
$ hledger -f- holdings -e 2026-03-01
