# ** 58. With a report interval, holdings shows the totals of the holdings at the end of each period,
# each computed as on that date (eg valued at its market prices, with realised gains and XIRR up to then).
<
commodity AAA ; lots:
account revenues:gains ; type: G

2026-01-01
  assets:broker  10 AAA @ $10
  assets:cash

2026-02-15
  assets:broker  -4 AAA @ $15
  assets:cash  $60
  revenues:gains

P 2026-01-31 AAA $12
P 2026-02-28 AAA $15
P 2026-03-31 AAA $9

$ hledger -f- holdings -M -e 2026-04-01
