# ** 61. A holding which has lost all of its value has an XIRR of -100%.
<
commodity F  ; lots:

2024-01-01 buy
    assets:broker    10 F @ $10
    assets:cash

P 2025-01-01 F $0

$ hledger -f - holdings -e 2025-06-01
